#                * gate              held-gate        working-product  every candidate
#                * regression-set    held-regression  working-product  every candidate
#                * regression-again  held-regression  working-product  every candidate
#                (*: all four, where --items names none; --items takes any of them, as
#                a root opened again after a repair needs fewer.) `regression-again` is
#                the regression set ONCE MORE under an id of its own, so that one stage
#                shows a kept baseline USED and not only kept. NO ROUTE HUNT, NO SECOND
